{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50106","headline":"游仙窟诗 咏崔五嫂 · 张文成","name":"游仙窟诗 咏崔五嫂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奇异妍雅，貌特惊新。\n眉间月出疑争夜，颊上花开似鬬春。\n细腰偏爱转，笑脸特宜嚬。\n真成物外奇稀物，实是人间断絶人。\n自然能举止，可念无方比。\n能令公子百重生，巧使王孙千回死。\n黑云裁两鬓，白雪分双齿。\n织成锦绣骐驎儿，判绣裙腰鹦鹉子。\n触处尽开怀，何曾有不佳。\n机关大雅妙，行步绝𡟛娃\n傍人一一丹罗韈，侍婢三三绿线鞵。\n黄龙透入黄金钏，白燕飞来白玉钗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张文成","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50106.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50106","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}